Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 00:06:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Android: model picker shows the provider of the chosen
 resolution; priced-at-Generate chips; nearest resolution with a note
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Server 2026-11-14 (one model, several providers): SuiteResolution reads provider, providerName, modelLabel,
livePrice. The pill reads "Seedance 2.5 · Higgsfield, 1080p"; a live-priced resolution's chip shows "priced at
Generate" instead of being hidden; switching models keeps the resolution when the new one makes it, else the nearest,
with a toast (as the Mac). PickerRoutesTest.

